          "title": "You'll want to know: சூதாடு",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சூதாடு — cūtāṭu — \"to gamble\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சூதாடினால் பணத்தை இழப்பாய். cūtāṭiṉāl paṇattai iḻappāy. If you gamble, you will lose money."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): சூதாடினேன், cūtāṭiṉēṉ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சூது \"gambling\" + ஆடு (āṭu) \"to play\". Gambling as a habit is சூதாட்டம்."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சூதாடு (cūtāṭu) joins சூது (cūtu), \"gambling\", from Sanskrit dyūta (CDIAL 6608), and the native ஆடு (āṭu), \"to play\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
