          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பணயம் வை — paṇayam vai — \"to stake; to risk\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அவர் தன் வீட்டையே பணயம் வைத்தார். avar taṉ vīṭṭaiyē paṇayam vaittār. He staked even his own house."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): பணயம் வைத்தேன், paṇayam vaittēṉ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is staked takes -ஐ. The ending -ஏ gives \"even\": வீட்டையே."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பணயம் வை (paṇayam vai) joins பணயம் (paṇayam), \"a stake\", from Sanskrit paṇa, \"a wager, a stake\" (CDIAL 7714), and the native light verb வை, \"to put\"."
            }
          ]
        },
