          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சகுனம் (cakuṉam) is borrowed from Sanskrit śakuna, \"a bird\", and so a sign read from birds, an omen (CDIAL 12245)."
            }
          ]
